File Index

/opponent-buckets.ts
Purpose: Defines health-based condition phrases and numerical ranges for opponent characters.

/opponentStatusStore.ts
Purpose: Caches the most recent enemy UI snapshot (label/pct/lastSeenTs) so useOpponentStatus can seed itself on a fresh mount instead of starting blank; isEnemyActive is still derived fresh from lastSeenTs, so a stale cache correctly reads as inactive.

/opponent-gates.ts
Purpose: Defines visual condition descriptions for opponent characters in the combat system.

/opponent-types.ts
Purpose: Defines types and utilities for managing opponent status display and opacity in the combat UI.

/probe-opponent-condition.ts
Purpose: Analyzes combat log lines to detect and extract opponent condition statuses.

/self-condition-buckets.ts
Purpose: Player-facing ("You...") reword of opponent-buckets.ts's same health tiers, for consumers that only have raw hp/hpMax numbers (no condition line to parse).
